{
 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "Imagine a birthday party.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 1.72
  },
  {
   "text": "The girl is six.",
   "start": 1.72,
   "duration": 1.48
  },
  {
   "text": "There are forty people",
   "start": 3.2,
   "duration": 0.94
  },
  {
   "text": "in the room,",
   "start": 4.14,
   "duration": 0.76
  },
  {
   "text": "and thirty of them",
   "start": 4.9,
   "duration": 0.76
  },
  {
   "text": "are her parents,",
   "start": 5.66,
   "duration": 1.0
  },
  {
   "text": "her grandparents, and the grandparents",
   "start": 6.66,
   "duration": 1.54
  },
  {
   "text": "of her grandparents.",
   "start": 8.2,
   "duration": 1.68
  },
  {
   "text": "The oldest guest is a hundred",
   "start": 9.88,
   "duration": 1.04
  },
  {
   "text": "and twenty-six.",
   "start": 10.92,
   "duration": 1.78
  },
  {
   "text": "He is not the one",
   "start": 12.7,
   "duration": 0.78
  },
  {
   "text": "in the wheelchair.",
   "start": 13.48,
   "duration": 1.04
  },
  {
   "text": "He's the one on the bouncy castle.",
   "start": 14.52,
   "duration": 1.96
  },
  {
   "text": "This is what the world looks",
   "start": 16.48,
   "duration": 0.82
  },
  {
   "text": "like when humans live to one",
   "start": 17.3,
   "duration": 1.42
  },
  {
   "text": "hundred and fifty.",
   "start": 18.72,
   "duration": 2.0
  },
  {
   "text": "And no, it isn't a world",
   "start": 20.72,
   "duration": 1.48
  },
  {
   "text": "of very old people.",
   "start": 22.2,
   "duration": 1.72
  },
  {
   "text": "It's a world where nobody leaves.",
   "start": 23.92,
   "duration": 2.34
  },
  {
   "text": "By the end,",
   "start": 26.26,
   "duration": 0.82
  },
  {
   "text": "you'll see why,",
   "start": 27.08,
   "duration": 0.96
  },
  {
   "text": "in this world,",
   "start": 28.04,
   "duration": 0.68
  },
  {
   "text": "the healthiest mother on the street",
   "start": 28.72,
   "duration": 1.7
  },
  {
   "text": "is her children's biggest problem.",
   "start": 30.42,
   "duration": 2.62
  },
  {
   "text": "It starts quietly.",
   "start": 33.04,
   "duration": 1.74
  },
  {
   "text": "One morning, ageing slows down,",
   "start": 34.78,
   "duration": 2.22
  },
  {
   "text": "for everyone, from wherever their body",
   "start": 37.0,
   "duration": 1.92
  },
  {
   "text": "already is.",
   "start": 38.92,
   "duration": 1.56
  },
  {
   "text": "A man blows out forty candles,",
   "start": 40.48,
   "duration": 2.14
  },
  {
   "text": "same as last year.",
   "start": 42.62,
   "duration": 1.82
  },
  {
   "text": "He'll now make it to about",
   "start": 44.44,
   "duration": 0.86
  },
  {
   "text": "a hundred and thirty.",
   "start": 45.3,
   "duration": 1.72
  },
  {
   "text": "His father, who's seventy,",
   "start": 47.02,
   "duration": 1.6
  },
  {
   "text": "gets twenty-odd bonus years.",
   "start": 48.62,
   "duration": 1.96
  },
  {
   "text": "And the baby born",
   "start": 50.58,
   "duration": 0.82
  },
  {
   "text": "in the hospital across town that morning?",
   "start": 51.4,
   "duration": 2.68
  },
  {
   "text": "She's the first human who will",
   "start": 54.08,
   "duration": 1.16
  },
  {
   "text": "ever see one hundred and fifty.",
   "start": 55.24,
   "duration": 2.38
  },
  {
   "text": "Across town, at a pension company,",
   "start": 57.62,
   "duration": 2.44
  },
  {
   "text": "someone changes one number",
   "start": 60.06,
   "duration": 1.2
  },
  {
   "text": "on a spreadsheet.",
   "start": 61.26,
   "duration": 1.74
  },
  {
   "text": "Eighty becomes one hundred and fifty.",
   "start": 63.0,
   "duration": 2.22
  },
  {
   "text": "Every cell below it turns red.",
   "start": 65.22,
   "duration": 2.16
  },
  {
   "text": "Because here's the thing we never notice.",
   "start": 67.38,
   "duration": 4.14
  },
  {
   "text": "The whole world is built around",
   "start": 71.52,
   "duration": 1.98
  },
  {
   "text": "people leaving.",
   "start": 73.5,
   "duration": 2.12
  },
  {
   "text": "You work for about forty years,",
   "start": 75.62,
   "duration": 2.1
  },
  {
   "text": "then you stop.",
   "start": 77.72,
   "duration": 1.34
  },
  {
   "text": "Your parents pass away,",
   "start": 79.06,
   "duration": 1.5
  },
  {
   "text": "and in your fifties,",
   "start": 80.56,
   "duration": 0.98
  },
  {
   "text": "you get the house.",
   "start": 81.54,
   "duration": 1.36
  },
  {
   "text": "The boss retires,",
   "start": 82.9,
   "duration": 1.32
  },
  {
   "text": "and somebody gets promoted.",
   "start": 84.22,
   "duration": 1.94
  },
  {
   "text": "Every few decades,",
   "start": 86.16,
   "duration": 1.62
  },
  {
   "text": "the jobs, the homes,",
   "start": 87.78,
   "duration": 1.62
  },
  {
   "text": "the money and the power all",
   "start": 89.4,
   "duration": 1.54
  },
  {
   "text": "come free again.",
   "start": 90.94,
   "duration": 1.78
  },
  {
   "text": "Death is the thing that moves",
   "start": 92.72,
   "duration": 1.36
  },
  {
   "text": "the queue.",
   "start": 94.08,
   "duration": 1.06
  },
  {
   "text": "Take that away,",
   "start": 95.14,
   "duration": 1.0
  },
  {
   "text": "and the queue stops moving.",
   "start": 96.14,
   "duration": 2.04
  },
  {
   "text": "And the first place you notice",
   "start": 98.18,
   "duration": 1.28
  },
  {
   "text": "is the family photo.",
   "start": 99.46,
   "duration": 2.14
  },
  {
   "text": "Today, a big family photo",
   "start": 101.6,
   "duration": 1.44
  },
  {
   "text": "has three rows.",
   "start": 103.04,
   "duration": 1.56
  },
  {
   "text": "Grandparents at the back,",
   "start": 104.6,
   "duration": 1.4
  },
  {
   "text": "parents in the middle,",
   "start": 106.0,
   "duration": 1.08
  },
  {
   "text": "kids on the floor.",
   "start": 107.08,
   "duration": 1.48
  },
  {
   "text": "In this world,",
   "start": 108.56,
   "duration": 0.86
  },
  {
   "text": "you retake it every twenty years,",
   "start": 109.42,
   "duration": 2.28
  },
  {
   "text": "and every time,",
   "start": 111.7,
   "duration": 1.24
  },
  {
   "text": "the frame gets wider.",
   "start": 112.94,
   "duration": 1.64
  },
  {
   "text": "By the time that baby",
   "start": 114.58,
   "duration": 1.58
  },
  {
   "text": "from the hospital is a great-great-grandmother,",
   "start": 116.16,
   "duration": 1.52
  },
  {
   "text": "it's five rows deep.",
   "start": 117.68,
   "duration": 3.2
  },
  {
   "text": "Five generations, all alive,",
   "start": 120.88,
   "duration": 2.5
  },
  {
   "text": "all healthy, all arguing about where",
   "start": 123.38,
   "duration": 2.52
  },
  {
   "text": "to sit.",
   "start": 125.9,
   "duration": 0.96
  },
  {
   "text": "And look at the front row.",
   "start": 126.86,
   "duration": 1.72
  },
  {
   "text": "It's almost empty.",
   "start": 128.58,
   "duration": 1.98
  },
  {
   "text": "If everyone lives twice as long",
   "start": 130.56,
   "duration": 1.48
  },
  {
   "text": "and keeps having kids at today's",
   "start": 132.04,
   "duration": 1.38
  },
  {
   "text": "pace, the planet runs out of room.",
   "start": 133.42,
   "duration": 2.04
  },
  {
   "text": "So families shrink.",
   "start": 135.46,
   "duration": 1.38
  },
  {
   "text": "The world grows to about nineteen",
   "start": 136.84,
   "duration": 1.52
  },
  {
   "text": "billion people, roughly double today,",
   "start": 138.36,
   "duration": 2.08
  },
  {
   "text": "and then it stops.",
   "start": 140.44,
   "duration": 1.6
  },
  {
   "text": "Children go from one in every",
   "start": 142.04,
   "duration": 1.0
  },
  {
   "text": "four people to one in eight.",
   "start": 143.04,
   "duration": 2.1
  },
  {
   "text": "A kid in this world is rare.",
   "start": 145.14,
   "duration": 2.08
  },
  {
   "text": "She is outnumbered by her own",
   "start": 147.22,
   "duration": 1.5
  },
  {
   "text": "ancestors at her own birthday party.",
   "start": 148.72,
   "duration": 2.98
  },
  {
   "text": "And if the family photo gets",
   "start": 151.7,
   "duration": 1.4
  },
  {
   "text": "longer, so does the marriage",
   "start": 153.1,
   "duration": 1.74
  },
  {
   "text": "in the middle of it.",
   "start": 154.84,
   "duration": 1.98
  },
  {
   "text": "Today, \"till death do us part\"",
   "start": 156.82,
   "duration": 1.64
  },
  {
   "text": "means about fifty years.",
   "start": 158.46,
   "duration": 2.12
  },
  {
   "text": "Here, marry at thirty,",
   "start": 160.58,
   "duration": 1.06
  },
  {
   "text": "and death is a hundred",
   "start": 161.64,
   "duration": 1.48
  },
  {
   "text": "and twenty years away.",
   "start": 163.12,
   "duration": 2.02
  },
  {
   "text": "That's a very long time",
   "start": 165.14,
   "duration": 1.34
  },
  {
   "text": "to agree on a thermostat.",
   "start": 166.48,
   "duration": 1.9
  },
  {
   "text": "So the vows change.",
   "start": 168.38,
   "duration": 1.5
  },
  {
   "text": "Couples start writing an end date",
   "start": 169.88,
   "duration": 1.34
  },
  {
   "text": "into them.",
   "start": 171.22,
   "duration": 0.94
  },
  {
   "text": "At the jeweller's,",
   "start": 172.16,
   "duration": 1.22
  },
  {
   "text": "wedding rings come engraved",
   "start": 173.38,
   "duration": 1.1
  },
  {
   "text": "with a year,",
   "start": 174.48,
   "duration": 0.88
  },
  {
   "text": "the way milk comes",
   "start": 175.36,
   "duration": 0.94
  },
  {
   "text": "with a date.",
   "start": 176.3,
   "duration": 1.42
  },
  {
   "text": "And Grandma's third wedding",
   "start": 177.72,
   "duration": 1.12
  },
  {
   "text": "is a lovely day.",
   "start": 178.84,
   "duration": 1.78
  },
  {
   "text": "Her first husband gives a speech.",
   "start": 180.62,
   "duration": 2.34
  },
  {
   "text": "Longer marriages are a choice.",
   "start": 182.96,
   "duration": 1.78
  },
  {
   "text": "Longer careers aren't.",
   "start": 184.74,
   "duration": 2.0
  },
  {
   "text": "Today, you start work at twenty,",
   "start": 186.74,
   "duration": 2.08
  },
  {
   "text": "stop at sixty-five,",
   "start": 188.82,
   "duration": 1.26
  },
  {
   "text": "and have about fifteen years left.",
   "start": 190.08,
   "duration": 2.46
  },
  {
   "text": "Here, stopping at sixty-five would leave",
   "start": 192.54,
   "duration": 1.96
  },
  {
   "text": "you eighty-five years with no pay.",
   "start": 194.5,
   "duration": 2.34
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody can save for that.",
   "start": 196.84,
   "duration": 1.82
  },
  {
   "text": "So the retirement age",
   "start": 198.66,
   "duration": 0.8
  },
  {
   "text": "has to move,",
   "start": 199.46,
   "duration": 0.74
  },
  {
   "text": "and once you do the sums,",
   "start": 200.2,
   "duration": 1.46
  },
  {
   "text": "it lands at about one hundred",
   "start": 201.66,
   "duration": 1.14
  },
  {
   "text": "and twenty.",
   "start": 202.8,
   "duration": 2.1
  },
  {
   "text": "Picture your first payslip at twenty.",
   "start": 204.9,
   "duration": 2.4
  },
  {
   "text": "Near the bottom,",
   "start": 207.3,
   "duration": 0.82
  },
  {
   "text": "a new line:",
   "start": 208.12,
   "duration": 1.38
  },
  {
   "text": "years to retirement, ninety-four.",
   "start": 209.5,
   "duration": 2.8
  },
  {
   "text": "But a hundred-year career",
   "start": 212.3,
   "duration": 1.16
  },
  {
   "text": "has a problem.",
   "start": 213.46,
   "duration": 1.54
  },
  {
   "text": "Whatever you learned at twenty",
   "start": 215.0,
   "duration": 1.2
  },
  {
   "text": "is useless by sixty.",
   "start": 216.2,
   "duration": 2.0
  },
  {
   "text": "So people go back to school,",
   "start": 218.2,
   "duration": 1.52
  },
  {
   "text": "again and again.",
   "start": 219.72,
   "duration": 1.86
  },
  {
   "text": "In a lecture hall,",
   "start": 221.58,
   "duration": 1.18
  },
  {
   "text": "a seventy-year-old sits next",
   "start": 222.76,
   "duration": 1.46
  },
  {
   "text": "to an eighteen-year-old.",
   "start": 224.22,
   "duration": 1.5
  },
  {
   "text": "Same course.",
   "start": 225.72,
   "duration": 1.12
  },
  {
   "text": "Same exam.",
   "start": 226.84,
   "duration": 1.22
  },
  {
   "text": "The seventy-year-old has fifty more years",
   "start": 228.06,
   "duration": 1.98
  },
  {
   "text": "of work ahead.",
   "start": 230.04,
   "duration": 1.64
  },
  {
   "text": "The eighteen-year-old has a hundred.",
   "start": 231.68,
   "duration": 2.26
  },
  {
   "text": "The seventy-year-old's CV is eleven pages long.",
   "start": 233.94,
   "duration": 3.94
  },
  {
   "text": "And a hundred years of work",
   "start": 237.88,
   "duration": 1.16
  },
  {
   "text": "means a hundred years of paying",
   "start": 239.04,
   "duration": 1.48
  },
  {
   "text": "for a home.",
   "start": 240.52,
   "duration": 1.38
  },
  {
   "text": "You'd think time would make everyone rich.",
   "start": 241.9,
   "duration": 2.66
  },
  {
   "text": "Give your savings a century",
   "start": 244.56,
   "duration": 1.3
  },
  {
   "text": "and a half to grow,",
   "start": 245.86,
   "duration": 1.04
  },
  {
   "text": "and a small pot becomes a fortune.",
   "start": 246.9,
   "duration": 2.58
  },
  {
   "text": "But everyone has the same idea,",
   "start": 249.48,
   "duration": 1.7
  },
  {
   "text": "all at once.",
   "start": 251.18,
   "duration": 1.42
  },
  {
   "text": "Open a savings book in this",
   "start": 252.6,
   "duration": 1.28
  },
  {
   "text": "world and watch the rate",
   "start": 253.88,
   "duration": 1.42
  },
  {
   "text": "on each new page.",
   "start": 255.3,
   "duration": 0.74
  },
  {
   "text": "It keeps getting smaller.",
   "start": 256.04,
   "duration": 2.32
  },
  {
   "text": "So people borrow instead,",
   "start": 258.36,
   "duration": 1.06
  },
  {
   "text": "and the banks invent the hundred-year mortgage.",
   "start": 259.42,
   "duration": 2.88
  },
  {
   "text": "It sounds cheap.",
   "start": 262.3,
   "duration": 1.08
  },
  {
   "text": "It isn't.",
   "start": 263.38,
   "duration": 1.44
  },
  {
   "text": "On a three hundred thousand dollar",
   "start": 264.82,
   "duration": 1.96
  },
  {
   "text": "house, the monthly payment drops",
   "start": 266.78,
   "duration": 0.72
  },
  {
   "text": "by less than three hundred dollars.",
   "start": 267.5,
   "duration": 2.18
  },
  {
   "text": "But you pay three",
   "start": 269.68,
   "duration": 1.04
  },
  {
   "text": "and a half times as much interest.",
   "start": 270.72,
   "duration": 2.18
  },
  {
   "text": "You're not really paying off the house.",
   "start": 272.9,
   "duration": 2.06
  },
  {
   "text": "You're renting it from the bank,",
   "start": 274.96,
   "duration": 1.48
  },
  {
   "text": "for the rest of your very",
   "start": 276.44,
   "duration": 1.18
  },
  {
   "text": "long life.",
   "start": 277.62,
   "duration": 1.18
  },
  {
   "text": "A letter arrives.",
   "start": 278.8,
   "duration": 1.86
  },
  {
   "text": "Payment eight hundred and forty-seven",
   "start": 280.66,
   "duration": 1.26
  },
  {
   "text": "of one thousand, two hundred.",
   "start": 281.92,
   "duration": 2.14
  },
  {
   "text": "Which is why everyone is waiting",
   "start": 284.06,
   "duration": 1.62
  },
  {
   "text": "for the other way to get",
   "start": 285.68,
   "duration": 1.32
  },
  {
   "text": "a house.",
   "start": 287.0,
   "duration": 0.98
  },
  {
   "text": "The one you inherit.",
   "start": 287.98,
   "duration": 1.8
  },
  {
   "text": "Today, you get your parents' home",
   "start": 289.78,
   "duration": 1.58
  },
  {
   "text": "in your fifties.",
   "start": 291.36,
   "duration": 1.58
  },
  {
   "text": "Here, your parents live to one",
   "start": 292.94,
   "duration": 1.34
  },
  {
   "text": "hundred and fifty.",
   "start": 294.28,
   "duration": 2.28
  },
  {
   "text": "They're thirty years older than you.",
   "start": 296.56,
   "duration": 1.94
  },
  {
   "text": "So you get the house",
   "start": 298.5,
   "duration": 0.76
  },
  {
   "text": "at one hundred and twenty.",
   "start": 299.26,
   "duration": 2.64
  },
  {
   "text": "Picture the queue for one house:",
   "start": 301.9,
   "duration": 2.34
  },
  {
   "text": "every heir waiting for someone",
   "start": 304.24,
   "duration": 1.72
  },
  {
   "text": "to die, stretching down the street",
   "start": 305.96,
   "duration": 2.44
  },
  {
   "text": "and round the block.",
   "start": 308.4,
   "duration": 1.72
  },
  {
   "text": "Walk down Marrow Street.",
   "start": 310.12,
   "duration": 1.94
  },
  {
   "text": "Forty houses.",
   "start": 312.06,
   "duration": 1.08
  },
  {
   "text": "Each front door is painted",
   "start": 313.14,
   "duration": 1.42
  },
  {
   "text": "with the year it was bought.",
   "start": 314.56,
   "duration": 1.88
  },
  {
   "text": "Not one of them has changed",
   "start": 316.44,
   "duration": 1.1
  },
  {
   "text": "hands in ninety years.",
   "start": 317.54,
   "duration": 2.18
  },
  {
   "text": "Today, about one home in forty-five",
   "start": 319.72,
   "duration": 2.02
  },
  {
   "text": "comes free each year when somebody dies.",
   "start": 321.74,
   "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
   "text": "Here, it's one in a hundred",
   "start": 324.74,
   "duration": 1.24
  },
  {
   "text": "and fifteen.",
   "start": 325.98,
   "duration": 1.66
  },
  {
   "text": "And there are twice as many",
   "start": 327.64,
   "duration": 1.42
  },
  {
   "text": "people who need one.",
   "start": 329.06,
   "duration": 1.48
  },
  {
   "text": "A brass key hangs inside one",
   "start": 330.54,
   "duration": 2.12
  },
  {
   "text": "of those doors.",
   "start": 332.66,
   "duration": 1.24
  },
  {
   "text": "It has a paper tag,",
   "start": 333.9,
   "duration": 1.28
  },
  {
   "text": "for writing each owner's name.",
   "start": 335.18,
   "duration": 2.34
  },
  {
   "text": "It's had one name",
   "start": 337.52,
   "duration": 1.08
  },
  {
   "text": "on it for a very long time.",
   "start": 338.6,
   "duration": 2.18
  },
  {
   "text": "So the young do something clever,",
   "start": 340.78,
   "duration": 1.68
  },
  {
   "text": "and a little bit dark.",
   "start": 342.46,
   "duration": 2.18
  },
  {
   "text": "At twenty-five, they sell their future",
   "start": 344.64,
   "duration": 1.9
  },
  {
   "text": "inheritance to a bank,",
   "start": 346.54,
   "duration": 1.28
  },
  {
   "text": "for cash today.",
   "start": 347.82,
   "duration": 2.08
  },
  {
   "text": "The bank now owns the right",
   "start": 349.9,
   "duration": 1.42
  },
  {
   "text": "to Mum's house.",
   "start": 351.32,
   "duration": 1.64
  },
  {
   "text": "And every year,",
   "start": 352.96,
   "duration": 0.8
  },
  {
   "text": "on Mum's birthday,",
   "start": 353.76,
   "duration": 1.52
  },
  {
   "text": "the bank sends her a card.",
   "start": 355.28,
   "duration": 1.86
  },
  {
   "text": "It asks how she's feeling.",
   "start": 357.14,
   "duration": 2.04
  },
  {
   "text": "The same queue that blocks",
   "start": 359.18,
   "duration": 1.12
  },
  {
   "text": "the front door blocks the top floor.",
   "start": 360.3,
   "duration": 2.46
  },
  {
   "text": "On the fortieth floor",
   "start": 362.76,
   "duration": 0.98
  },
  {
   "text": "of the Greyfield Exchange,",
   "start": 363.74,
   "duration": 1.56
  },
  {
   "text": "the desk nameplates are engraved in brass.",
   "start": 365.3,
   "duration": 2.92
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody prints them anymore.",
   "start": 368.22,
   "duration": 1.54
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody has moved desks in eighty years.",
   "start": 369.76,
   "duration": 3.18
  },
  {
   "text": "Today, a top boss keeps",
   "start": 372.94,
   "duration": 1.14
  },
  {
   "text": "the job for about seven years.",
   "start": 374.08,
   "duration": 2.14
  },
  {
   "text": "Here, the same boss can stay",
   "start": 376.22,
   "duration": 1.52
  },
  {
   "text": "for forty.",
   "start": 377.74,
   "duration": 1.12
  },
  {
   "text": "Take five hundred of the biggest",
   "start": 378.86,
   "duration": 1.32
  },
  {
   "text": "jobs in a country.",
   "start": 380.18,
   "duration": 1.42
  },
  {
   "text": "Today, about seventy of them open",
   "start": 381.6,
   "duration": 1.68
  },
  {
   "text": "up every year.",
   "start": 383.28,
   "duration": 1.14
  },
  {
   "text": "Here, it's about twelve.",
   "start": 384.42,
   "duration": 1.94
  },
  {
   "text": "Outside one corner office,",
   "start": 386.36,
   "duration": 1.84
  },
  {
   "text": "a man in a sharp suit",
   "start": 388.2,
   "duration": 1.34
  },
  {
   "text": "sits on a bench.",
   "start": 389.54,
   "duration": 1.38
  },
  {
   "text": "He's ninety-one.",
   "start": 390.92,
   "duration": 1.6
  },
  {
   "text": "He's been waiting for this job",
   "start": 392.52,
   "duration": 1.32
  },
  {
   "text": "since he was fifty.",
   "start": 393.84,
   "duration": 1.76
  },
  {
   "text": "Every ten years,",
   "start": 395.6,
   "duration": 0.96
  },
  {
   "text": "he asks the same thing.",
   "start": 396.56,
   "duration": 1.88
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Is he in?\" He's in.",
   "start": 398.44,
   "duration": 2.46
  },
  {
   "text": "The same goes for judges,",
   "start": 400.9,
   "duration": 1.52
  },
  {
   "text": "for professors, for anyone who holds",
   "start": 402.42,
   "duration": 2.24
  },
  {
   "text": "a seat until they choose to leave.",
   "start": 404.66,
   "duration": 2.68
  },
  {
   "text": "In a courthouse hallway,",
   "start": 407.34,
   "duration": 1.42
  },
  {
   "text": "six portraits hang side by side.",
   "start": 408.76,
   "duration": 2.36
  },
  {
   "text": "It's the same judge.",
   "start": 411.12,
   "duration": 1.58
  },
  {
   "text": "Each one is a little greyer.",
   "start": 412.7,
   "duration": 2.14
  },
  {
   "text": "So ambition leaves.",
   "start": 414.84,
   "duration": 2.1
  },
  {
   "text": "If you can't climb the old",
   "start": 416.94,
   "duration": 1.24
  },
  {
   "text": "ladder, you build a new one.",
   "start": 418.18,
   "duration": 2.5
  },
  {
   "text": "Every founder is under forty,",
   "start": 420.68,
   "duration": 2.04
  },
  {
   "text": "because only a brand new company",
   "start": 422.72,
   "duration": 1.68
  },
  {
   "text": "has no queue.",
   "start": 424.4,
   "duration": 1.68
  },
  {
   "text": "And the one thing young people",
   "start": 426.08,
   "duration": 1.44
  },
  {
   "text": "vote for, over and over,",
   "start": 427.52,
   "duration": 2.38
  },
  {
   "text": "is term limits.",
   "start": 429.9,
   "duration": 0.72
  },
  {
   "text": "On everything.",
   "start": 430.62,
   "duration": 1.84
  },
  {
   "text": "Now, to be fair,",
   "start": 432.46,
   "duration": 1.76
  },
  {
   "text": "some of this is wonderful.",
   "start": 434.22,
   "duration": 2.2
  },
  {
   "text": "A surgeon with ninety years of practice.",
   "start": 436.42,
   "duration": 3.32
  },
  {
   "text": "A teacher who taught your grandmother,",
   "start": 439.74,
   "duration": 1.56
  },
  {
   "text": "and now teaches you,",
   "start": 441.3,
   "duration": 2.16
  },
  {
   "text": "and still remembers what your grandmother",
   "start": 443.46,
   "duration": 1.88
  },
  {
   "text": "was like at your age.",
   "start": 445.34,
   "duration": 2.3
  },
  {
   "text": "Longer lives have always made",
   "start": 447.64,
   "duration": 1.44
  },
  {
   "text": "the world richer.",
   "start": 449.08,
   "duration": 1.58
  },
  {
   "text": "That part is true.",
   "start": 450.66,
   "duration": 1.54
  },
  {
   "text": "But only if the old let go.",
   "start": 452.2,
   "duration": 2.9
  },
  {
   "text": "And that's where it turns upside down.",
   "start": 455.1,
   "duration": 2.82
  },
  {
   "text": "Remember the bank's birthday card?",
   "start": 457.92,
   "duration": 2.16
  },
  {
   "text": "Every year it asks Mum how she's feeling.",
   "start": 460.08,
   "duration": 2.22
  },
  {
   "text": "And every year,",
   "start": 462.3,
   "duration": 1.06
  },
  {
   "text": "she writes back: never better.",
   "start": 463.36,
   "duration": 3.64
  },
  {
   "text": "Every one of those cards",
   "start": 467.0,
   "duration": 1.3
  },
  {
   "text": "is another year her children rent.",
   "start": 468.3,
   "duration": 3.14
  },
  {
   "text": "In this world,",
   "start": 471.44,
   "duration": 1.18
  },
  {
   "text": "your parents' long,",
   "start": 472.62,
   "duration": 1.18
  },
  {
   "text": "happy, healthy life is your single",
   "start": 473.8,
   "duration": 2.3
  },
  {
   "text": "biggest bill.",
   "start": 476.1,
   "duration": 1.64
  },
  {
   "text": "It's the one thing nobody says",
   "start": 477.74,
   "duration": 1.84
  },
  {
   "text": "out loud at the birthday party.",
   "start": 479.58,
   "duration": 2.46
  },
  {
   "text": "And then there's death itself.",
   "start": 482.04,
   "duration": 2.48
  },
  {
   "text": "It doesn't vanish.",
   "start": 484.52,
   "duration": 1.12
  },
  {
   "text": "It changes shape.",
   "start": 485.64,
   "duration": 1.86
  },
  {
   "text": "You still get old.",
   "start": 487.5,
   "duration": 1.22
  },
  {
   "text": "It just starts around one hundred",
   "start": 488.72,
   "duration": 0.84
  },
  {
   "text": "and thirteen.",
   "start": 489.56,
   "duration": 1.84
  },
  {
   "text": "Your knees hand in their notice.",
   "start": 491.4,
   "duration": 2.04
  },
  {
   "text": "You slow down for your last",
   "start": 493.44,
   "duration": 1.38
  },
  {
   "text": "thirty-odd years, instead of your last fifteen.",
   "start": 494.82,
   "duration": 2.9
  },
  {
   "text": "But the biggest killer isn't age anymore.",
   "start": 497.72,
   "duration": 2.6
  },
  {
   "text": "It's the road.",
   "start": 500.32,
   "duration": 1.56
  },
  {
   "text": "A car crash at forty used",
   "start": 501.88,
   "duration": 1.7
  },
  {
   "text": "to cost forty years.",
   "start": 503.58,
   "duration": 1.86
  },
  {
   "text": "Now it costs one hundred and ten.",
   "start": 505.44,
   "duration": 2.34
  },
  {
   "text": "People start driving like they",
   "start": 507.78,
   "duration": 2.06
  },
  {
   "text": "have a lot to lose.",
   "start": 509.84,
   "duration": 0.9
  },
  {
   "text": "Because they do.",
   "start": 510.74,
   "duration": 2.58
  },
  {
   "text": "St Aldric's crematorium only needs half",
   "start": 513.32,
   "duration": 2.2
  },
  {
   "text": "its building now.",
   "start": 515.52,
   "duration": 1.48
  },
  {
   "text": "The other half becomes a nursery.",
   "start": 517.0,
   "duration": 2.32
  },
  {
   "text": "One chimney.",
   "start": 519.32,
   "duration": 0.96
  },
  {
   "text": "One playground.",
   "start": 520.28,
   "duration": 1.08
  },
  {
   "text": "One car park.",
   "start": 521.36,
   "duration": 1.48
  },
  {
   "text": "And the undertaker's apprentice has been",
   "start": 522.84,
   "duration": 1.98
  },
  {
   "text": "training for sixty years.",
   "start": 524.82,
   "duration": 1.82
  },
  {
   "text": "He's never actually seen a body.",
   "start": 526.64,
   "duration": 2.36
  },
  {
   "text": "Remember the girl at the birthday party?",
   "start": 529.0,
   "duration": 2.32
  },
  {
   "text": "She's one hundred and twenty now.",
   "start": 531.32,
   "duration": 2.12
  },
  {
   "text": "She has a job,",
   "start": 533.44,
   "duration": 1.38
  },
  {
   "text": "a mortgage, and a son who's ninety.",
   "start": 534.82,
   "duration": 3.04
  },
  {
   "text": "This morning, her mother died,",
   "start": 537.86,
   "duration": 1.08
  },
  {
   "text": "peacefully, in the garden,",
   "start": 538.94,
   "duration": 2.02
  },
  {
   "text": "at one hundred and fifty.",
   "start": 540.96,
   "duration": 3.24
  },
  {
   "text": "She walks up to a door",
   "start": 544.2,
   "duration": 1.32
  },
  {
   "text": "on Marrow Street.",
   "start": 545.52,
   "duration": 1.82
  },
  {
   "text": "The brass key is still hanging inside.",
   "start": 547.34,
   "duration": 3.38
  },
  {
   "text": "Under her mother's name,",
   "start": 550.72,
   "duration": 0.92
  },
  {
   "text": "on a tag that has waited",
   "start": 551.64,
   "duration": 1.32
  },
  {
   "text": "a hundred and fifteen years,",
   "start": 552.96,
   "duration": 2.88
  },
  {
   "text": "she writes a second one.",
   "start": 555.84,
   "duration": 1.6
  },
  {
   "text": "Her own.",
   "start": 557.44,
   "duration": 1.24
  },
  {
   "text": "We like to think a life",
   "start": 558.68,
   "duration": 1.1
  },
  {
   "text": "is a ladder.",
   "start": 559.78,
   "duration": 1.04
  },
  {
   "text": "You start at the bottom,",
   "start": 560.82,
   "duration": 1.46
  },
  {
   "text": "you climb, you reach the top.",
   "start": 562.28,
   "duration": 2.44
  },
  {
   "text": "It was always a queue.",
   "start": 564.72,
   "duration": 1.58
  },
  {
   "text": "And the only thing that ever",
   "start": 566.3,
   "duration": 1.32
  },
  {
   "text": "moved it was death.",
   "start": 567.62,
   "duration": 1.74
  }
 ],
